sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant H as HiCache
  participant D as NIXL/SSD
  participant G as GPU KV
  S->>H: request prefix restore
  H->>H: validate manifest and ABI
  loop page-aligned chunks
    H->>D: async read data + scales
    D-->>H: chunk
    H->>G: materialize chunk
    G-->>H: checksum/ownership ack
  end
  H->>G: attach Mamba/GDN/MTP endpoint state
  H-->>S: hit only after full validation
